</li></ul>

== Walkthrough ==

[[Gerael Woodone]] may be found at -180, -395.

You say, 'Hail, Gerael Woodone'

: Gerael Woodone says 'It is good to meet you, ______.  You, my friend,  are an adventurer.  The rugged look of you testifies to that. Let me know if you plan to adventure in the Plains of Karana.  I have need of a person  such as yourself to [deliver a flask].'

You say, 'I will deliver a flask.'

: Gerael Woodone says 'That is splendid!  I thought I would have to take the  long journey to the western Plains of Karana myself.  Here you are, my  friend.  Take this flask of nitrates to a woman named Linaya Sowlin.  It  will help her crops grow stronger.  You will find her farm alongside the  road to Highpass Hold.  She should pay you well for the delivery.   Farewell.'

'''You receive a [[Flask of Nitrates]]. [[Linaya Sowlin]] may be found at -3745, -7655 in Western Karana, in a farmhouse. Give her the flask.'''

: Linaya Sowlin says 'Oh thank [[Tunare]] you showed up when you did.  I was at a nearby merchant house when a fellow dropped a [note] and I picked it up  and read it.  It talked of the [Unkempt Druids] and before I could read  on, the man swiped it from my hands.  I ran for dear life, for surely he would kill me for reading the note.  I think I lost him in the woods but I  am not sure.  Please stay with me a while to be sure.'

